      "body": "[positive] use DMAC as the solvent during assembly of Zn-triazole-carboxylate shared paddle-wheel MOFs → DMAC enabled generation of crystalline structures 1 and 2, whereas water, DMF, or DEF gave only unknown-phase powders"
